<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, position: 'relative', overflow: 'hidden', background: '#0B1120', fontFamily: '微软雅黑' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 110, paddingLeft: 64, paddingRight: 64, paddingTop: 34, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 34, background: '#38BDF8' }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 700, color: '#F8FAFC', letterSpacing: 0.5 }}>六层架构，两张图</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 546, paddingLeft: 64, paddingRight: 64, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 24 }}>
        <Box style={{ height: 282, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
            <Box style={{ height: 42, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#16223A', border: '1px solid rgba(248,250,252,0.10)', borderRadius: 6, paddingLeft: 20, paddingRight: 20, gap: 20 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 700, color: '#F8FAFC', width: 96 }}>交互层</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.62)' }}>原生 Web（零构建）· Gradio 演示 · FastAPI + Uvicorn</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ height: 42, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: 'rgba(56,189,248,0.10)', border: '1px solid rgba(56,189,248,0.45)', borderRadius: 6, paddingLeft: 20, paddingRight: 20, gap: 20 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 700, color: '#38BDF8', width: 96 }}>编排层</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.80)' }}>LangGraph 两张图 —— 单 Agent 主图（6 节点）+ Supervisor 多 Agent 图</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ height: 42, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#16223A', border: '1px solid rgba(248,250,252,0.10)', borderRadius: 6, paddingLeft: 20, paddingRight: 20, gap: 20 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 700, color: '#F8FAFC', width: 96 }}>模型层</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.62)' }}>LLMClient（OpenAI 兼容协议）→ DeepSeek 实测打通 ｜ 规则引擎兜底</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ height: 42, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: 'rgba(56,189,248,0.10)', border: '1px solid rgba(56,189,248,0.45)', borderRadius: 6, paddingLeft: 20, paddingRight: 20, gap: 20 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 700, color: '#38BDF8', width: 96 }}>工具层</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.80)' }}>自建 ToolRegistry —— 超时 / 重试 / 熔断 / 幂等，5 个工具，MCP 风格 Schema</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ height: 42, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#16223A', border: '1px solid rgba(248,250,252,0.10)', borderRadius: 6, paddingLeft: 20, paddingRight: 20, gap: 20 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 700, color: '#F8FAFC', width: 96 }}>记忆层</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.62)' }}>短期 Redis（跑内存降级）｜ 长期 SQLite ｜ 语义字符 bigram Jaccard</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ height: 42, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#16223A', border: '1px solid rgba(248,250,252,0.10)', borderRadius: 6, paddingLeft: 20, paddingRight: 20, gap: 20 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 700, color: '#F8FAFC', width: 96 }}>数据层</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.62)' }}>SQLite：family · custom_scene · device · room · device_seed_log</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ height: 240, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 690, background: '#16223A', border: '1px solid rgba(248,250,252,0.10)', borderRadius: 10, padding: '26px 28px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 700, color: '#F8FAFC' }}>真正让它不像玩具的，是工具层</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.62)', lineHeight: 1.75, marginTop: 14 }}>
                    超时、重试、熔断（30 秒半开）、幂等、降级，全部内建在注册中心里——<br />
                    业务 handler 只管干活，不操心这些。<br />
                    <span style={{ color: '#38BDF8' }}>好处是答辩时能指着代码讲：策略在哪一行、为什么是这个值。</span>
                </Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 438, background: 'rgba(56,189,248,0.06)', border: '1px solid rgba(56,189,248,0.28)', borderRadius: 10, padding: '26px 28px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#38BDF8', letterSpacing: 2, fontWeight: 700 }}>一句话判断</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 700, color: '#F8FAFC', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 16 }}>
                    六个层里，只有编排层和工具层是我真正花时间的地方。
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.75, marginTop: 14 }}>
                    其余四层要么是现成的，要么是降级实现。
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 64, paddingLeft: 64, paddingRight: 64, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.40)' }}>HomeMind · 智能家居多智能体中枢</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.40)', fontFamily: 'Consolas' }}>04 / 13</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
